000gd; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 28.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">4.</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">专项赛</span></strong></p>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 406.2pt; height: 145px; border: medium none currentcolor;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 41px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 104.566px; padding-top: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext; text-align: center; height: 41px;\" valign=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>赛项</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 167.439px; padding-top: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext; text-align: center; height: 41px;\" valign=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">科目名称</span></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 224.366px; padding-top: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext; text-align: center; height: 41px;\" valign=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">省赛/全国选拔赛时间</span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 103.767px; padding-top: 0pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-bottom: 0pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; height: 104px; text-align: center;\" valign=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">专项赛</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 166.641px; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; height: 104px;\" valign=\"center\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">鸿蒙应用开发</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 223.568px; padding: 0pt 5.4pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; height: 104px;\" valign=\"center\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">2027年4月24日周六</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">9:00—13:00</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 28.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15pt; font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 30.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 28.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">二、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">注意事项</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">1.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">为</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">满足参赛选手</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">全面发展</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">提升个人专业能力的需求</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">参赛选手可</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">结合自身兴趣</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">及</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">各赛项时间安排，报名参加多个赛项。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">2.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">对于比赛时间相同的科目，参赛选手仅限选择其中一个科目报名；对于比赛时间不同的科目，参赛选手可根据自身情况报名参加多个科目。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">3.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">软件赛和电子赛（软件测试、网络安全和</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">5G全网规划与</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">建设科目除外）全国总决赛计划于</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">2027年6月12日举办。如选手在省赛中有多个科目晋级全国总决赛，须在决赛时仅选择其中一个科目报名参加。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">4.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">各院校参赛师生可在赛前两周登录大赛官网报名系统，查看</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">比赛赛点</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">情况。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">5.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">参赛师生赛前一周在报名系统下载并自行打印准考证。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">6.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">具体</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">比赛方式、比赛地点</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">和比赛时间以准考证公布为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">7.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">请各参赛院校提前安排好学生的备赛工作。如有疑问请到大赛官网</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">“联系我们”中咨询各省份</span></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">组委会</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">负责老师。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 